	(text "GAIN_SLOT to VDD = 6 dB gain (tested on the breadboard; 9 dB clips).\nSD_MODE: R20 100k keeps the amp off during boot. GPIO HIGH = on, left channel.\nEP (pin 17) is not connected inside the chip: wire it to GND, vias in the pad.\nC20 + C21 + star ground removed the breadboard crackle. Keep all three, at the chip.\nSpeaker: Dayton CE32A-8 (8 Ω). Do not connect either speaker wire to GND.\nNC pins 5, 6, 12, 13 are hidden on the stock symbol (no connect)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4e66d331-e81e-5e80-be53-9e1d6204105d")
	)
